$PAE=\left( PB-0.5\right)\ast BA\ast \log \left( EP+1\right)$\end{document}
. When integrating all neoantigens from a patient, we also incorporated variant allele frequency (VAF) and adjusted the score for each neoantigen. First, we combined all peptides of a mutation:
